  "message": "wp433 P2c-R: dot bien 2 cua fragment reparse theo dac ta r1b (mat na mo rong, a = 528)\n\nDac ta GWS-CRED-DICH-NGOAI-KHO-R r1b (sha256 43d60d7c8fa6...), Issue #433.\n\nPhep thay cu cua `db_reparse_moi_thu` (ve thuoc tinh thanh `!= 0`) chet SAI LUOT tren Windows: `os.lstat`\ndat `st_file_attributes` khac 0 cho moi entry that (thu muc 16, goc o 22), nen o luot `W5.bit` vong tien to\nchan tai goc o thay vi tai cfgdir. Do: mo phong Linux (moi entry that mang attr 16 => run False) va probe\nnative tren Desktop do phien dieu phoi chay.\n\n- `db_reparse_moi_thu`: mat na thanh `stat.FILE_ATTRIBUTE_REPARSE_POINT | stat.FILE_ATTRIBUTE_SPARSE_FILE`.\n- Luot `W5.khong_bit` gia lap `FILE_ATTRIBUTE_DIRECTORY | FILE_ATTRIBUTE_SPARSE_FILE` (528).\n- Tai sinh scripts/tl_test_fragments_bundled.py bang generate_bundled_module_bytes.\n\n`scripts/tl_gws.py` khong doi so voi commit truoc.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxrYN8oeEszoAzSfeQFV",
